# DIBAY Marketplace Browse — SINGLE CONTRACT (Implementation Gate)

**STATUS: DESIGN CLOSED — READY TO IMPLEMENT (REGION/RANGE/SEARCH gates + PTR additive).**
**PRODUCT CODE MODIFIED FOR THIS GATE: 0 until explicit implementation cut.**

Full design thread: marketplace REGION / RANGE / SEARCH / FILTER / RESET audit (2026-08-20).

## DO NOT (without reopen)

- Reopen CUT A–J / UI-1~6 marketplace chrome locks for browse semantics
- DB migration / new global location store / silent 64km fallback
- `location=all` as DEFAULT (DEFAULT = master LGU + range 전체)
- Conflate **↺ TOP RESET** / **filter 전체 초기화** with **Pull-to-Refresh**
- PTR that mutates URL, sort, q, region, range, or runs master/hydrate reset

---

## 1. REGION / RANGE (unchanged)

| State | Candidate universe | Ordering priority |
|---|---|---|
| **anchor + 전체** (`radiusKm==null`) | Nationwide — **no SQL location WHERE** | Anchor LGU first → other regions |
| **anchor + N km** (`radiusKm!=null`) | **Within N km only** — hard EXCLUDE outside | User sort within boundary |
| **`location=all`** | Nationwide — **no anchor, no region priority** | User sort only |

Mandatory feed fixes (prior gate): flip `wantsBrowsePriority` to `radiusKm==null`; legacy row disjoint outside partition; SEARCH `relatedOut` OFF when `radiusKm!=null`.

---

## 2. SEARCH (unchanged)

When `q` present: **exact → similar → expansion** at all sorts (`latest` / `popular` / `distance`).
Sort changes **ordering only**, not candidate universe.

---

## 3. FILTER / RESET (unchanged)

- **Committed authority = URL** (not filter draft, not session alone).
- **↺ TOP RESET** = **filter 「전체 초기화」** → shared `buildMarketplaceBrowseResetCommittedHref` (DEFAULT: master + range 전체; **`q` preserved**).
- Filter draft-only clear **≠** reset — both must navigate to same reset href (Option B).

---

## 4. PULL-TO-REFRESH — meaning

Trade LIST vertical swipe refresh:

```text
CURRENT COMMITTED STATE (URL + all query params)
+ CURRENT QUERY refetch
+ reflect new/changed/hidden/deleted posts
```

PTR is **NOT**: reset, filter init, region/range/search/sort change, URL mutation, master hydrate clear.

### 4.1 Preserved across PTR (URL BEFORE = URL AFTER)

`location`, `lgu`, `radius`, `category`, `categoryIds`, `topic`, `topicByRoot`, composition filters, `priceMin`, `priceMax`, `tradeState`, **`q`**, **`sort`**.

Pagination **internal window** may reset to fresh page 1 / first ranked window — user-visible URL unchanged.

### 4.2 REGION / RANGE on PTR

- **Pasay + 전체**: Pasay priority + nationwide refresh — no URL change.
- **Pasay + 5km**: 5km hard boundary — no outside leakage on refresh.
- **`location=all`**: nationwide, no anchor priority.

### 4.3 SEARCH on PTR

- **`q` + Pasay + 전체**: same tiers, same anchor, fresh matching posts.
- **`q` + Pasay + 5km**: `q` kept, `relatedOut` OFF, 5km boundary kept.

### 4.4 SORT on PTR

PTR **must NOT** force `sort=latest`.

| sort | PTR behavior |
|---|---|
| `latest` | New matching posts → top per latest |
| `popular` | Refetch → re-apply popular ordering |
| `distance` | Refetch → re-apply distance ordering |

```text
REFRESH = DATA REFETCH
SORT CHANGE = NO
```

### 4.5 Pagination on PTR

- Invalidate client feed cache + **search ranked window** for current committed key.
- Fresh **page 1 / first window** — no old page-2 window mixed with new fetch.
- Goals: duplicate 0, stale row 0, missing new row 0.

### 4.6 RESET separation

| Action | Effect |
|---|---|
| ↺ TOP RESET | DEFAULT filter state |
| Filter 전체 초기화 | Same as ↺ |
| **Pull-to-Refresh** | Same filters/search — **data reload only** |

### 4.7 URL / SESSION on PTR

Forbidden on PTR: `router.replace`, strip location, delete `q`, change sort/defaults, `master address reset`, default hydrate, `trade committed scope clear`.

Exception: separate **MASTER CHANGE** event → existing master-change contract wins.

